---
import Store from '../layouts/Store.astro';
import { perch } from '../data/perch';
---
<Store title="Terms & purchase information — Perch"><article class="shell section policy"><p class="eyebrow">Perch / Terms</p><h1>Before you perch.</h1><p>Last updated: October 14, 2026.</p><h2>Current availability</h2><p>Perch is being prepared for distribution. Purchases are closed. This website does not currently accept payment or promise a delivery date. Product previews show sample activity, not a connection to your agents.</p><h2>Price and offer</h2><p>The Perch app will cost $29 USD as a one-time purchase, plus applicable taxes shown at checkout. The offer is for the native Mac app, including the agent-activity shelf and sticky notes. Source code, coding-agent subscriptions, and API usage are not included.</p><h2>License and purchase terms</h2><p>The intended purchase grants a non-expiring license to use the purchased version. Final license terms, device limits, update coverage, support, delivery, cancellation, and refund details will be published before purchases open. This page does not grant a software license or authorize redistribution.</p><h2>Compatibility</h2><p>Perch requires macOS 14 or later. Provider integrations depend on third-party behavior and may change. Claude Code CLI and Cursor local Agent activity have been checked; live Codex coverage remains under verification. Cursor’s passive hooks do not expose permission-waiting status. Perch does not reply to agents or approve their actions.</p><h2>Seller and contact</h2><p>The Stripe account selected for the upcoming offer is One Trinity Consulting Inc. For availability and product questions, <a href={perch.support}>contact the project maintainers</a>.</p></article></Store>
<style>.policy{max-width:800px}.policy h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);margin:20px 0 30px}.policy h2{font-size:26px;margin:35px 0 14px}.policy p{color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0}.policy a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}</style>
